2>02 数学与代码</h2><p>行内公式 <math><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mi>β</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>；字符 ∑∞ ≠ ⅓，H<sub>2</sub>O，x<sup>2</sup>。</p><math display=\"block\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math><pre style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; background: rgb(238, 243, 242); padding: 12px;\"><code>  const literal = `a | b`;\n\n  if (x &lt; 2 &amp;&amp; y &gt; 0) {\n    console.log(\"中文 α\", \"```\");\n  }\n</code></pre></section><section class=\"panel\" style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(172, 185, 186);\"><h2>03 图形与原生行为</h2><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 180\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"plot\"></linearGradient></defs><path d=\"M30 10V150H310\" stroke=\"#172b2c\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M30 130L100 90L180 110L290 25V150H30Z\" fill=\"url(#plot)\"></path><text x=\"80\" y=\"175\">时间 t · 图例 α</text><text x=\"3\" y=\"20\">y</text></svg><canvas id=\"plotCanvas\" width=\"320\" height=\"80\"></canvas><details><summary>参数与说明</summary><p>本地折叠可以保留。</p><details><summary>更多细节</summary><p></p></details></details><button onclick=\"this.textContent='来源动作'\">未知业务行为</button><label>隐私输入 <input value=\"SECRET-DO-NOT-EXPORT\"></label></section></div><section class=\"panel\" style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(172, 185, 186); color: rgb(23, 43, 44); font-family: system-ui; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><h2>04 宽表格与合并单元格</h2><div class=\"scroll\" style=\"overflow: auto; width: 440px;\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\"